[{"id":"cnp_028_q1","topicId":"cnp_028","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"一块冰的体积是 2 m³，冰的密度取 0.9×10³ kg/m³，它的质量是多少 kg？（只填数值）","answer":"1800","explanation":"m = ρV = 900 × 2 = 1800 kg。","verify":"0.9e3*2"},{"id":"cnp_028_q2","topicId":"cnp_028","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"冬天室外的自来水管容易冻裂，原因是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"水结冰后质量变大"},{"key":"B","text":"水结冰后质量不变、体积变大"},{"key":"C","text":"水结冰后密度变大"},{"key":"D","text":"水管遇冷变大"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"冰的密度比水小，质量不变时体积变大，把水管胀裂。","verify":"\"水结冰后质量不变、体积变大\""},{"id":"cnp_028_q3","topicId":"cnp_028","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"一个金属块质量 158 g、体积 20 cm³，查表可知它可能是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"铝（2.7 g/cm³）"},{"key":"B","text":"铜（8.9 g/cm³）"},{"key":"C","text":"铁（7.9 g/cm³）"},{"key":"D","text":"铅（11.3 g/cm³）"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"ρ = 158 ÷ 20 = 7.9 g/cm³，与铁的密度相同。","verify":"\"铁（7.9 g/cm³）\""},{"id":"cnp_028_q4","topicId":"cnp_028","difficulty":"advanced","type":"choice","prompt":"一个瓶子最多装 500 g 水，用它装酒精（0.8 g/cm³），最多能装多少？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"500 g"},{"key":"B","text":"625 g"},{"key":"C","text":"400 g"},{"key":"D","text":"800 g"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"瓶子容积 V = 500 g ÷ 1 g/cm³ = 500 cm³，装酒精 m = 0.8 × 500 = 400 g。","verify":"0.8*500"}]
